cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the software (this repository) and, for the gridded CF4 prior, the Zenodo dataset below."
title: "Climate Solutions Research Kit: open spatial-prior method and smelter-resolved CF4 (PFC-14) prior"
abstract: "Reusable method and five worked case studies for building point-source-resolved spatial priors for orphaned high-GWP greenhouse gases, plus the published open smelter-resolved spatial prior for CF4 emissions from primary-aluminium smelting and a published HFC-134a refrigerant-bank negative result."
type: software
